  "description": "After moving to Seoul from her small hometown, a young woman is determined to make the city her permanent home. However, rising living costs and a difficult job market leave her with no choice but to return to the countryside. Hoping to avoid running into anyone she knows, she accepts a part-time job at a small shop far from home, recommended by a friend. But what seems like an ordinary job turns out to be something far more unusual and unexpectedly provocative. What kind of strange and steamy experiences await her at this mysterious little shop?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
